    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; (Using properties of definite integration)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi